# Odin III's Phase 2 opt script (2F spec section 3, OP-3; Parmys lines 1-4 and 6 of synthesis.tcl).
# `proc` ends with opt_expr -keepdc (step F), so no separate opt_expr follows it. `opt` never
# compacts (IR-6 unchanged, PHASE2 #19): the script compacts after it.
opt_expr
opt_clean
opt -nodffe -nosdff
proc
opt
compact
